---
import DiagramFigure from './DiagramFigure.astro'

// The construct-validity gap. Correctness is the construct you are accountable
// for; faithfulness is the operationalization that is easy to measure. They come
// apart exactly where the retrieved page and the customer's account disagree,
// Daniel's legacy plan. A metric pointed at the proxy paints that gap green.

const ariaLabel =
  'Two columns. On the left, the construct you are accountable for: correctness, meaning true for this customer. On the right, the operationalization you actually measure: faithfulness, meaning the answer matches the page it retrieved. Between them, a highlighted gap labelled: they diverge exactly where the page and the account disagree. Below, a statistic: in a NeurIPS 2025 audit of 445 LLM benchmarks, only 53.4 percent presented any evidence for their own construct validity.'
---

<DiagramFigure label="Faithfulness is not correctness" ariaLabel={ariaLabel} data-cgap>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto_1fr] items-stretch gap-3">
    <div class="cgap-construct rounded border px-4 py-3">
      <span class="font-mono text-mono-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">Construct · what you owe</span>
      <p class="m-0 mt-1 text-sm text-text-primary font-medium">Correctness</p>
      <p class="m-0 mt-1 font-mono text-mono-xs text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
        true for <em>this</em> customer, matches the account &amp; catalog
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="cgap-gap flex md:flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 px-2 py-2">
      <span class="font-mono text-mono-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-error text-center leading-tight">the gap</span>
      <span class="font-mono text-mono-xs text-text-muted text-center leading-tight">page&nbsp;≠ account</span>
    </div>

    <div class="cgap-proxy rounded border px-4 py-3">
      <span class="font-mono text-mono-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-text-muted">Proxy · what you measure</span>
      <p class="m-0 mt-1 text-sm text-text-primary font-medium">Faithfulness</p>
      <p class="m-0 mt-1 font-mono text-mono-xs text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
        matches the page retrieval surfaced, green even when the page is wrong for them
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <Fragment slot="note">
    A NeurIPS 2025 audit of 445 LLM benchmarks found only 53.4% presented any
    evidence for their own construct validity. Measuring the proxy and reporting
    it as the construct is the whole bug.
  </Fragment>
</DiagramFigure>

<style is:global>
  [data-cgap] .cgap-construct {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-primary) 55%, transparent);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-primary) 7%, transparent);
  }
  [data-cgap] .cgap-proxy {
    border-color: var(--color-border-dark);
    background: var(--color-surface-container-low);
  }
  [data-cgap] .cgap-gap {
    border-left: 2px dashed color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-error) 55%, transparent);
    border-right: 2px dashed color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-error) 55%, transparent);
  }
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    [data-cgap] .cgap-gap {
      border: none;
      border-top: 2px dashed color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-error) 55%, transparent);
      border-bottom: 2px dashed color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-error) 55%, transparent);
    }
  }
</style>
